{"overview":"در حاشیهٔ یک روستای ساحلی، زنی ماهیگیر زندگی می‌کند؛ بوی بد، مجرد و همیشه مورد تمسخر قرار گرفته. روزی از خستگی به همسایگان کوچک‌فکر و محدودش، او تصمیم می‌گیرد همسر خود را از چوب بنس ساخته و در شهر محافظه‌کار، این رابطهٔ غیرمعمول باعث خشم، حسادت و آشوب می‌شود.","tagline":"","overview_en":"On the outskirts of a village by the sea, lives a Fisherwoman; smelly, single and perpetually ridiculed. One day, fed up with her stuffy, small-minded neighbours, she commissions herself a husband to be made from wicker. In an otherwise conservative town, this unconventional romance sparks outrage, jealousy and chaos.","tagline_en":"Marriage material.","runtime":105,"status":"Released","seasons":[],"episodes":null,"crew":["Alex Huston Fischer","Eleanor Wilson"],"crew_en":[],"countries":["GB","US"],"cast":[{"name":"الیویا کلمن","role":"Fisherwoman","photo":"/lawJUdbLb1YW0niaYjiVGR9IBG8.jpg","en":"Olivia Colman"},{"name":"الکساندر اسکارشگرد","role":"Wicker Husband","photo":"/6VNNddrSrIVgdzhXr4Zg89gmOzY.jpg","en":"Alexander Skarsgård"},{"name":"پیتر دینکلیج","role":"Basket Weaver","photo":"/9CAd7wr8QZyIN0E7nm8v1B6WkGn.jpg","en":"Peter Dinklage"},{"name":"الیزابت دبیکی","role":"Tailor’s Wife","photo":"/nTTnQVTn13Ve4ifjRY9v8kVc99w.jpg","en":"Elizabeth Debicki"},{"name":"Marli Siu","role":"Basket Weaver's Sister","photo":"/pNi3TfnnJuDz25m93Nr2AKIYV4R.jpg"},{"name":"Nabhaan Rizwan","role":"Tailor","photo":"/ljDpNmRnx9Mxe6DZbOMVZlGVXAN.jpg"},{"name":"ریچارد ای گرانت","role":"Doctor","photo":"/92oaBntIXhndCxUXaGywUyILIIE.jpg","en":"Richard E. Grant"},{"name":"Kiell Smith-Bynoe","role":"","photo":"/6pVa2SEgMfR2u7E3xfIUGZSqinh.jpg"},{"name":"Gustav Lindh","role":"","photo":"/qbCsiIl0C0E1vYvLXqK2T98bvyO.jpg"},{"name":"Ella Bruccoleri","role":"Bakerwoman","photo":"/xVqbUOELKqxhEdqAz5IXhFYp7Uy.jpg"},{"name":"Ben Ashenden","role":"Baker","photo":"/qwE3vNi5PDIQIOeTcYzR0iVWj8g.jpg"},{"name":"Phil Daniels","role":"","photo":"/6yNFNjo3cWEcuAUrl0CNQnAnQ5M.jpg"}],"trailer":"UVAki9SGrlg","wa